IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bgg4-nouns`
IMPORT `bgg4-new-submissions`

-- bgg4-tests-new-submissions: tests for Art 99.  Expected values are written from the text.

§ `Art 99 tests`

-- (1) "Neue Tatsachen und Beweismittel dürfen nur so weit vorgebracht werden, als erst der Entscheid der Vorinstanz dazu Anlass gibt."
#ASSERT `Art 99(1) the new fact or new evidence may be put forward` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 99(1) the new fact or new evidence may be put forward` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not a new fact or new evidence: not covered
#ASSERT `Art 99(1) the new fact or new evidence may be put forward` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 99(1) the new fact or new evidence may be put forward` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2) "Neue Begehren sind unzulässig."
#ASSERT `Art 99(2) the new claim is admissible` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 99(2) the new claim is admissible` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
